<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title>Quên mật khẩu - Pet Clinic</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@4.6.2/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css"></head>
